&lt;h2&gt;About my contributions&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;🗣 I am an &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/AliSoftware/talks&quot;&gt;international conference speaker&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt; 
