&lt;h2&gt;About my expertise&lt;/h2&gt; 
&lt;p&gt;I create and provide tools to iOS developers to improve their productivity. This includes:&lt;/p&gt; 
&lt;ul&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;🤖 Automating the release process to QA, TestFlight, AppStore…&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;👥 Improving the PR review experience (using Danger and Vapor Bots to interact with your PRs, among others)&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;⏱ Improving the iOS CIs pipelines and build times&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;⚙️ Providing integration between tools for developers, QA &amp;amp; product (GitHub, JIRA, Lokalize, Figma, TestRails, CI, …)&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;📋 Consulting on testing strategies (project testability, balance between Unit/UI/Snapshot/manual tests, interaction with QA…)&lt;/li&gt; 
 &lt;li&gt;✨ And much more 🙂&lt;/li&gt; 
&lt;/ul&gt; 
